@startuml job-preparation-service-class-diagram
title Level 3: Code - Class Diagram (job-preparation-service) - FR-12\nOwner: Arwa Mohey Hamdy
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
  BackgroundColor<<component>> #D5EFE0
  BorderColor<<component>> #2E8B57
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}
hide empty members

legend right
  |<#D5EFE0>   | Class of a component |
  |<#FFFFFF>   | Interface / domain class |
  | Solid arrow, open head | Uses (required interface / class) |
  | Dotted arrow, hollow head | Implements (provided interface) |
  | Filled diamond | Composition |
  | Plain line | Association |
endlegend

interface IJobPrep <<provided>> {
  +addApplication(studentId, data): Application
  +setStatus(applicationId, status): void
  +addPrepItem(applicationId, type, text): PrepItem
  +recordOutcome(applicationId, outcome, feedback): void
}

class JobPreparationService <<component>> {
  -repository: IApplicationRepository
  -applicationValidator: ApplicationValidator
  --
  +addApplication(...) / setStatus(...)
  +addPrepItem(...) / recordOutcome(...)
}

IJobPrep <|.. JobPreparationService
class ApplicationValidator <<component>> {
  +validate(data): ValidationResult
}
JobPreparationService --> ApplicationValidator

interface IApplicationRepository <<required - Database>> {
  +save(item: Application): void
  +findById(id): Application
  +findByOwner(ownerId): List<Application>
}

JobPreparationService --> IApplicationRepository
class Application {
  -applicationId: String
  -company: String
  -position: String
  -status: String
  -deadline: Date
  -outcome: String
  -feedback: String
}
class PrepItem {
  -type: String
  -text: String
  -done: boolean
  --
  +markDone(): void
}
IApplicationRepository --> Application
Application *-- "0..*" PrepItem
note bottom of JobPreparationService
SOLID applied:
S - JobPreparationService only coordinates; ApplicationValidator each do one job.
O - new behaviour is added by new implementations, not by editing JobPreparationService.
L - JobPreparationService can replace any other IJobPrep implementation.
I - IJobPrep has only the operations its clients use.
D - JobPreparationService depends on interfaces (IApplicationRepository), not on concrete classes.
end note
@enduml
